{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2022-03-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'GENERAL MOTORS NAMES HARMAN A 2021 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FOR THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR, GENERAL MOTORS HAS RECOGNIZED HARMAN, A WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS CO., LTD. FOCUSED ON CONNECTED TECHNOLOGIES FOR AUTOMOTIVE, CONSUMER AND ENTERPRISE MARKETS, AS A 2021 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR. GM CELEBRATED HONOREES AT ITS 30TH ANNUAL SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR AWARDS CEREMONY IN PHOENIX, ARIZONA, EARLIER THIS WEEK. GM'S SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR AWARD RECOGNIZES GLOBAL SUPPLIERS THAT DISTINGUISH THEMSELVES BY EXCEEDING"}